I have been using OpenVPN Service to run my clients vpn connections on Wind=
ows 8 and have noticed that they never starts automatically even though its=
 set to.

I have found that to fix this you need to go into services.msc and in OpenV=
PN Service you need to go to the Log On tab and change the Local System acc=
ount to Allow service to interact with desktop.  Is this expected behaviour=
 or only new because of Win 8/10

Thanks,

Ryan


